---
description: Keep important Cleanora code documented with short easy-English comments.
globs: "{src/**/*.ts,scripts/**/*.ts,tests/**/*.ts}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow `docs/standards/code-comments.md`.
- Add JSDoc to exported handlers, middleware, use cases, repository operations,
  adapters, and scripts.
- HTTP handlers use `@desc`, `@route`, `@access`, and `@explanation`.
- Explain intent and safety; do not narrate obvious syntax.
- Keep comments updated and never include secrets or sensitive examples.
